### Secrets — keep firebase/service configs out of git ###
google-services.json

# Generated install QR codes — they encode a machine-specific or release-specific URL
# and are rebuilt on demand, so there is nothing to gain from versioning one.
install-qr*.png

# Any variant of the local config, not just the exact name.
#
# `/local.properties` alone let `local.properties.bak` into commit 05b02c1 — with the
# release keystore password, the key password and the Maps API key in it — and onto a
# public remote. A backup of a secrets file is still a secrets file.
local.properties*

# Play Console demo recordings. They are screen captures of a scripted emulator run,
# reshootable from store-assets/release/take3.py, and tens of megabytes each — the
# console wants a link to one, not a copy in the history.
store-assets/release/*.mp4
